        {
          "header": "Cook — build the sauce",
          "body": "Melt butter in a heavy pan over medium heat. Fry garlic and ginger paste for 1 minute until fragrant. Add tomato purée and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the oil separates from the sauce."
